# Milestone: M6 Wave 2 (Phase 2 follow-up)
# Covers: T41 install-time arity validation for `get`/`set` parse sugar.
#
# Pre-fix: a wrong-arity getter / setter would compile cleanly and
# install successfully; the dispatch-time invocation later read from
# uninitialized register slots → SIGSEGV.  Post-fix: rejected at
# Object.setProperty install time with an ArityError emitted to stderr
# and a TypeError surfaced from the OP_CALL native arm.
#
# stderr is merged with stdout by the chk runner; the ArityError line
# (from urbi_raise_arity, no [N] frame) interleaves before the
# TypeError [N] frame line.

var Foo = Object.clone(); Foo.get x(a, b) { a + b }; Foo.x
[] ArityError: get expected 0 args, got 2
[00000000] !!! TypeError: CALL: native method raised

var Bar = Object.clone(); Bar.set y() { 42 }; Bar.y = 1
[] ArityError: set expected 1 args, got 0
[00000001] !!! TypeError: CALL: native method raised

var Baz = Object.clone(); Baz.set z(a, b) { a + b }; Baz.z = 1
[] ArityError: set expected 1 args, got 2
[00000002] !!! TypeError: CALL: native method raised
